    "原生客户端报告当前模型额度受限；自动等待新的恢复证据。": "The native client reported a model quota limit. Awaiting a new reading confirming recovery.",
    "曾确认额度耗尽；等待原生客户端刷新，重置时间经过不等于已恢复。": "Quota was exhausted. A fresh native reading is needed to confirm recovery after reset.",
    "原生额度偏低；请保留检查点并减少非必要交接。": "Native quota is low. Save a checkpoint and limit optional handoffs.",
